     "content_html": "<p>Use the power rule. If you raise a non-zero base to an exponent <i>n</i>, and raise that to another exponent, <i>m</i>, you get the base raised to the product of the exponents, which is <span data-math=\"{\\left( {{a^n}} \\right)^m} = {a^{\\left( {n \\times m} \\right)}}\"></span>.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"{\\left( {{a^7}} \\right)^6} = {a^{\\left( {7 \\times 6} \\right)}} = {a^{42}}\"></span></p>"
